# Glider feel

When editing player physics, camera follow, or verification tests:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/glider-game-feel/SKILL.md` first.
2. Keep raycast surf (`collision_mask = 0`); do not enable terrain collision or floor snap to fix clips.
3. Change one feel subsystem per pass; run `scripts/run-verify.ps1` after physics edits.
4. Do not weaken `verify_glider.gd` assertions — fix the controller or revert.
